---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import PostList from "../components/PostList.astro";

import {
  SITE_DESCRIPTION,
  SITE_TITLE
} from "../consts";


const posts = (await getCollection("blog"))

  .sort(
    (a,b) =>
      b.data.pubDate.valueOf()
      -
      a.data.pubDate.valueOf()
  )

  .slice(0,5);

---


<!doctype html>

<html lang="en">


<head>

<BaseHead
  title={SITE_TITLE}
  description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
/>

</head>


<body>


<Header />


<main>


<section class="hero">


<h1>
Neo Blog
</h1>


<p>

记录交易、问题和思考。

一个长期积累的个人知识系统。

</p>


</section>




<section class="categories">



<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}trading/`}>

<h2>
Trading
</h2>


<p>
记录交易观察、决策过程和复盘经验。
</p>


</a>





<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}tools/`}>

<h2>
工具人系列
</h2>


<p>
记录那些没人教你，
但有一天你可能会用到的问题解决经验。
</p>


</a>





<a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}notes/`}>

<h2>
随笔
</h2>


<p>
记录随着时间沉淀下来的想法、观察和经验。
</p>


</a>



</section>





<section class="latest">


<h2>
Latest Posts
</h2>



<PostList posts={posts} />


</section>



</main>



<Footer />


</body>


</html>




<style>


main {

width:
calc(100% - 2rem);

max-width:
720px;

margin:
auto;

}




.hero {

text-align:

center;


padding:

6rem 0 5rem;

}



.hero h1 {

font-size:

3rem;


margin-bottom:

1rem;

}



.hero p {

color:

rgb(var(--gray));


line-height:

1.8;


max-width:

500px;


margin:

auto;

}



.categories {

display:

flex;


flex-direction:

column;


gap:

2rem;

}



.categories a {

text-decoration:

none;


color:

inherit;


padding:

1.5rem 0;


border-bottom:

1px solid

rgb(var(--gray-light));

}



.categories h2 {

margin:

0 0 0.5rem;

}



.categories p {

color:

rgb(var(--gray));


line-height:

1.7;

}




.latest {

margin-top:

5rem;

}



.latest h2 {

margin-bottom:

2rem;

}



</style>